---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ListItem from "../../../components/ui/ListItem.astro";

import ApCspIcon from "../../../assets/courses/ap-csp/img/ap-csp-icon.svg";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="py-5 mb-3 bg-sn-darker bottom-shadow">
    <div class="p-5">
      <a href="/#course-content" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light"
        ><i class="si-arrow-left"></i> Back</a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="container pb-5">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1>AP Computer Science Principles</h1>
        <ApCspIcon width={128} height={128} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-10">
        <h3>About This Course</h3>

        <p>
          <b class="text-sn-theme">A full year of computer science that starts
          from nothing.</b> You will write Lua, draw and animate with LÖVE,
          build the Create Performance Task you submit to the College Board, and
          prepare for the AP exam. No prior programming experience is assumed.
        </p>

        <p>
          Most of what you write this year puts something on a screen. You open
          a window in the second session and keep drawing from there &mdash;
          shapes, motion, collisions, and eventually a game you design yourself.
          The rest of the time you work in text, where text is genuinely the
          point.
        </p>

        <h3 class="mt-5">Course Content</h3>

        <h6 class="text-sn-theme mt-2">Setup</h6>
        <ListItem>
          <a href="./setup">Setting Up Your Workspace</a>
        </ListItem>

        <h4 class="mt-4">Quarter 1: Creative Development, and the Language</h4>

        <h6 class="text-sn-theme mt-3">Tables</h6>
        <ListItem>
          <a href="./unit-1/1-18">Activity 1.18: Tables as Lists</a>
        </ListItem>
        <ListItem>
          <a href="./unit-1/1-19"
            >Activity 1.19: How Long, and What Is Not There</a
          >
        </ListItem>

        <h6 class="text-sn-theme mt-4">Bonus Projects</h6>

        <p class="text-body-secondary">
          Optional, extra credit, and not required by anything later. Each one
          says which session you need to have reached.
        </p>

        <ListItem tag="Extra Credit">
          <a href="./unit-1/bp-pong">Bonus Project: Pong</a>
        </ListItem>

        <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
          <b>The rest of the activity pages are being written.</b> Start with the
          setup page above &mdash; getting the workspace open and a program
          running is session one either way.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
